tities.\n\nEntity Filter – Selects which entities are displayed by ESP.\n\nCustom Colors – Customizes ESP colors with Rainbow mode support.\n\nESP Style – Supports Tracers, Box ESP, Skeleton ESP, and Distance labels.\n\nFullbright – Improves visibility throughout the map.\n\nNo Fog – Removes atmospheric fog.\n\nSee Through Closets – Makes closets transparent.\n\nAlerts – Displays notifications for nearby entities, items, and padlock hints.\n\nField of View – Adjusts the camera FOV from 40 to 120.\n\nThird Person – Enables an adjustable third-person camera.\n\nFreecam – Allows free camera movement with adjustable speed.\n\nStatus Labels – Displays current Oxygen and Haste levels.\n\nAuto Rooms – Automatically opens and progresses through rooms.\n\nRoom Skip – Skips to specific rooms or the next door.\n\nKnob Farm – Automatically loots drawers for Knobs.\n\nDeath Farm – Automates the reset loop.\n\nAuto Minecart – Automates minecart jumping and turning.\n\nSeek Helper – Skips Seek chase interactions.\n\nFigure Helper – Locally removes the Figure entity.\n\nAuto Revive – Automatically revives downed teammates.\n\nRejoin Server – Rejoins the current server.\n\nReset Character – Resets your character.\n\nLeave to Lobby – Returns to the game lobby.\n\nFake Revive – Sends a revive request without consuming items.\n\nMenu Keybind – Changes the key used to toggle the interface.\n\nUnload – Completely removes the script and interface.\nHere are tags in the same style for DOORS:\n\nDOORS Roblox, DOORS script, DOORS Roblox script, DOORS free script, Roblox DOORS, DOORS auto farm, DOORS auto room, DOORS room skip, DOORS god mode, DOORS infinite items, DOORS noclip, DOORS fly, DOORS speed, DOORS ESP, DOORS entity ESP, DOORS player ESP, DOORS auto hide, DOORS auto grab items, DOORS auto minigame, DOORS padlock solver, DOORS library solver, DOORS teleport, DOORS fullbright, DOORS no fog, DOORS infinite jump, DOORS anti AFK, DOORS entity bypass, DOORS seek helper, DOORS figure helpe